        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Zingmei gaanc patro Aram nzuan ni.",
            "Kandih khou hei abumaeng chun kei mak",
            "Pou rui damlou mei salem than zuan ni.",
            "",
            "He! theina ringdat pui nung",
            "Tigun daihmei, Namthan gaimei khou zailou o,",
            "Duipaeng ram gaimei khou . Zingmei, thei mei",
            "Ngan na ai rui thuan ni.",
            "",
            "2. Poubaomei ai kap nanglun houmak na",
            "Achun geicna bam kei bam guang thui mak.",
            "Zion pi tei buithang bam kan tu cho?",
            "",
            "3. Ringhmei Poubaomei achaeng zing mei khou.",
            "Gaanc guang o Poubaomei achaeng maan the.",
            "Lung zing mei le tarou rui gumliam the.",
            "",
            "4. Ai ringhmei panti tarou khou ruina.",
            "Kanloumei nun nkhuan pui bam zuan ni.",
            "Duikhuan chumak mei khou ai zaeng thaek ni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
